OL,5,G1200 Inside Hampton Court Palace
OL,6,     FGet up close and personal with the
OL,7,     Fpalace warders as they take us
OL,8,     Finto the huge kitchens and secret
OL,9,     Fnooks. The staff are preparing for
OL,10,     Fthe biggest memorial the palace
OL,11,     Fhas ever seen.
OL,12,G1300 The Royals Uncensored
OL,13,     FKatie Nicholl and Jo Elvin host
OL,14,     Fthis show that pulls back the
OL,15,     Fvelvet curtain on the world's most
OL,16,     Ffamous family with fearless
OL,17,     Fdebate, insider analysis and
OL,18,     Fexclusive insights.
